Package: certarium
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Certarium Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), systemd | systemd-sysv
Description: local RSA and TLCP certificate laboratory
 Certarium is a loopback-only private PKI workbench for issuing, revoking,
 and testing RSA and TLCP certificates with CRL and OCSP support.
